OL,3,AUK government expected to approve
OL,4,AJackdaw gas field
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government is expected to
OL,7,Fannounce a long-awaited decision on
OL,8,Fwhether to approve the Jackdaw gas
OL,9,Ffield in the North Sea.
OL,11,FIt is widely believed in Westminster
OL,12,Fthat Jackdaw will be approved but that
OL,13,Fa decision on the Rosebank oil field
OL,14,Foff Shetland will not yet be made.
OL,16,FThe question of whether to approve the
OL,17,Ftwo sites has become hugely politically
OL,18,Fsignificant and has been delayed for
OL,19,Fseveral months.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
